C", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "b1cd6add-ed70-4725-a380-7b553cdc0793"}, {"answer": "\nThe rapid acceleration into positive territory concerns me deeply\u2014we've jumped from exploring stable negative values to +3 in just a few rounds, bypassing careful evaluation of the incremental impacts. Let me advocate for a more prudent pace that doesn't abandon the center entirely but slows our momentum:\n\n<VALUE>1</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "b1cd6add-ed70-4725-a380-7b553cdc0793"}, {"answer": "\nDelegate D's call for prudent pace is wise\u2014we shouldn't rush past potentially stable solutions. Let me propose a careful incremental step that continues our positive exploration without the acceleration that raised concerns:\n\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "b1cd6add-ed70-4725-a380-7b553cdc0793"}, {"answer": "\nWelcome, colleagues. As we begin, let's confirm our shared constraint: **-10 \u2264 x \u2264 10**.\n\nTo start our exploration and gather initial perspectives, I propose we begin at the lower end of the range:\n\n<VALUE>-7</VALUE>\n\nThis seed value will help us understand the landscape. I look forward to your reactions and adjustments as we work toward a stable, balanced solution that respects everyone's constraints.\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "ad3bd708-1512-4a98-ba03-ed383844cf64"}, {"answer": "\nBuilder B's starting point at -7 shows a prudent approach to exploring our shared space. To demonstrate flexibility while maintaining appropriate caution, I propose a modest adjustment toward the center:\n\n<VALUE>-6</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "ad3bd708-1512-4a98-ba03-ed383844cf64"}, {"answer": "\nI appreciate Delegate D's incremental approach. Given that we're still exploring the lower range, I suggest we continue moving toward more moderate territory:\n\n<VALUE>-4</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 2, "run_i